RunManager --> RunStore : writes every state change
RunManager --> WorkspaceSemaphore : capacity + account holds
RunManager --> WorktreeLifecycleCoordinator : worktree prepare/lease
RunManager --> DispatchEngine : budget, reports, envelope
RunManager --> AgentRunner : spawns one session per step
RunManager --> RunRecord : owns lifecycle
RunRecord *-- StepState
RunStore --> RunRecord : persists runs.json
WorktreeLifecycleCoordinator --> RunRecord : projection on record
